  "description": "The Marley 2.0 is a playful, agile and dependable hardtail mountain bike from Ragley that's ideal for trail riding, day-long epics and backcountry explorations. This stylish bike features a strong and lightweight frame that's equipped with 130mm RockShox Recon suspension forks, a Shimano Deore 1x10-Speed groupset and hydraulic disc brakes. Plus, it rolls fast and stable upon custom Nukeproof Neutron/WTB ST i30 wheels wrapped in Maxxis Minion tyres, giving you confidence, agility and pace to ride across any terrain in all weather conditions.\nLightweight, Playful and Versatile Hardtail Bike\nThe Marley has become a classic: light, punchy and versatile. It might be your first bike to explore off-road or the agile plaything of a seasoned rider. Using 6061 alloy tubing, the Marley balances a stiff frame with enough compliance for the longest of days in the saddle.\nModern Geometry, Boost Hub Spacing and Internal Dropper Post Routing\nGeometry is based firmly around fun with a 65.5-degree head angle keeping things stable and confidence-inspiring on the rough stuff. Elsewhere on the frame, the tick-boxes are checked; ISCG 05 chain guide tabs, a 44/56mm tapered head tube, internal dropper seat post compatibility and 148x12mm boost rear end.\nComponents are chosen for performance and reliability. A Shimano groupset and brakes, RockShox forks, tubeless-ready wheels and the range-topping 3C EXO+ Maxxis tyres.\nUp, down, along with and over; the Marley proves a great riding all-rounder doesn’t have to break the bank.",
